@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "But how about when you have dashboards that are shared with others";
    Layout = "~/Areas/Azure/Views/Shared/AzureLayout.cshtml";
}

@await Html.PartialAsync("~/Areas/Azure/Views/Shared/AzureContentStyles.cshtml")

<div class="row g-4">
    <aside class="col-lg-3">
        @Html.Partial("~/Areas/Azure/Views/Shared/AzureTopics.cshtml")
    </aside>
    <section class="col-lg-9">
        <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm">
            <div class="card-body p-4 p-lg-5">
                <div class="azure-notes-content">
                    <pre class="azure-notes-text">But how about when you have dashboards that are shared with others, like for example the one that
you are sharing like the inventory dashboard? So, let’s assume you go to my shared dashboard. You
can tell it’s a shared dashboard because there is this shared icon right there beside your dashboard
name. Everything works the same. You can refresh manually. You can refresh your titles.




And you can also see this Auto-Refresh here under the dashboard title.




The only difference here now is that let’s say you share this with others. You want to see this every
hour, but someone else wants to see this updated every 30 minutes. You can go ahead and set this
every hour and this will only apply to look at this dashboard. When you open this dashboard
somewhere else, you can go ahead and change it to every 30 minutes and you’d be looking at it
every 30 minutes, and it won’t have any conflict between the two dashboards.</pre>
                    <div class="text-center my-4">
                        <img src="/Images/AzureNotes/Chapter_7_-_Dashboards/p09-000.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm" alt="But how about when you have dashboards that are shared with others - source image" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center my-4">
                        <img src="/Images/AzureNotes/Chapter_7_-_Dashboards/p09-001.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm" alt="But how about when you have dashboards that are shared with others - source image" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center my-4">
                        <img src="/Images/AzureNotes/Chapter_7_-_Dashboards/p09-002.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm" alt="But how about when you have dashboards that are shared with others - source image" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center my-4">
                        <img src="/Images/AzureNotes/Chapter_7_-_Dashboards/p09-003.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm" alt="But how about when you have dashboards that are shared with others - source image" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center my-4">
                        <img src="/Images/AzureNotes/Chapter_7_-_Dashboards/p10-000.jpg" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-sm" alt="But how about when you have dashboards that are shared with others - source image" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    

            @await Html.PartialAsync("~/Areas/Azure/Views/Shared/AzureLessonNavigation.cshtml")
</section>
</div>
